  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DIVERSITY. Intersectional views, decolonial paths</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This projects aims to put ethical-political commitment into practice by making higher education more accessible and inclusive to historically discriminated and excluded groups. It aims to institutionalize the intercultural gender perspective and be an active and proactive agency of excluded voices, in dialogue with the university community.</narrative>
  </description>
